# The injected Location row (RC_JOBS=rc.jobs.locrow8): open Settings at the
# Privacy page with the system's own URL, three times a dozen seconds apart --
# a prefs: URL that launches Settings from cold lands on its root page, the
# next one navigates -- and hold the page for the screenshots.  The URL is
# quoted: unquoted, the shell's '&' split it and only "prefs:root=Privacy"
# was ever opened.  No Sileo, no taps: nothing here is blind.
/redwood/bin/sleep_hold 200 &
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 10
/var/jb/usr/bin/uiopen 'prefs:root=Privacy&path=LOCATION'
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 12
/var/jb/usr/bin/uiopen 'prefs:root=Privacy&path=LOCATION'
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 12
/var/jb/usr/bin/uiopen 'prefs:root=Privacy&path=LOCATION'
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 100
